## Accomplishments Overview

### 1. Modern Glassmorphism Design System (`src/index.css`)
- Custom CSS variable tokens, Google Fonts (`Outfit` & `Inter`), dark mode palette (`#0b0f17`), glassmorphism cards (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)`), glowing button gradients, status badges (`badge-pending`, `badge-approved`, `badge-rejected`, `badge-overridden`), and micro-animations.

### 2. Authentication Context & Quick Role Fill (`src/context/AuthContext.jsx`, `src/pages/Login.jsx`)
- Configured Axios client with `withCredentials: true` pointing to backend API `http://localhost:5000/api`.
- Created dark mode Login page with 1-click quick-fill buttons for demo roles (`Senior Accountant`, `Finance Manager`, `System Admin`, `Audit Viewer`).

### 3. Action Center AI Dashboard & Review Panel (`src/pages/ActionCenter.jsx`, `src/components/ActionCenterDrawer.jsx`)
- **Main Action Center Dashboard**: Displays incoming deposit cases, status badges, confidence scores, search bar, status filters, and "Analyze" trigger buttons.
- **Action Center Slide-Over Drawer**:
  - Displays incoming bank deposit evidence (Amount, Sender Name, Account Number, Narration Reference).
  - Displays AI Candidate Recommendation (Company, Loan, Installment Schedule).
  - Dynamic **Confidence Score Ring** ($\ge 90\%$ Green, $70-89\%$ Yellow, $<70\%$ Red).
  - Multi-line **AI Reasoning Breakdown** detailing evidence matching signals.
  - **1-Click Settlement Controls**: `[Approve Match]`, `[Reject Match]`, and `[Manual Override]`.

### 4. Section 17 Payment Ingestion Page (`src/pages/PaymentIngestion.jsx`)
- Form to ingest raw bank deposits with instant duplicate checking and case creation + historical deposits table.

### 5. Borrowing Companies & Loans Directory (`src/pages/CompanyList.jsx`, `src/pages/LoanList.jsx`)
- Corporate borrower directory with modal to add companies.
- Loan facilities list with loan creation modal and 1-click repayment schedule inspector.

### 6. Compliance Audit Trail Page (`src/pages/AuditLogs.jsx`)
- Immutable compliance audit log viewer displaying JSON snapshot payloads, timestamps, user details, and actions.

